{"seq":1,"slug":"spatial-audio","title":"空间音频与声像","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/web-audio-sound-engineering/practice/spatial-audio","wordCount":1202,"readingTime":5,"html":"<h1 id=\"空间音频与声像\">空间音频与声像</h1><p>闭上眼睛,你能听出谁在你左后方说话、汽车从哪个方向驶来——人耳定位声源靠的是两只耳朵收到声音的微小差异:时间差、响度差、还有耳廓对不同方向声音的频率染色。把这套定位线索在浏览器里重建出来,声音就不再是「从屏幕里平铺出来」,而是真正悬在三维空间的某个位置。这是 WebXR、3D 游戏、虚拟会议沉浸感的核心。本节从最简单的左右声像出发,一路到 PannerNode 的完整 3D 模型,再到用 HRTF 在普通耳机上骗过大脑的方位感。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>空间化有三个层次,复杂度和真实感递增:</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  L1[&quot;StereoPannerNode&lt;br/&gt;一维: 左 ↔ 右&lt;br/&gt;只改左右声道响度&quot;] --&gt; L2[&quot;PannerNode + equalpower&lt;br/&gt;三维位置 + 距离衰减&lt;br/&gt;便宜·近似&quot;]&#10;  L2 --&gt; L3[&quot;PannerNode + HRTF&lt;br/&gt;三维 + 头相关传输函数&lt;br/&gt;耳机上真方位感·昂贵&quot;]&#10;  L3 --&gt; LIS[&quot;AudioListener&lt;br/&gt;听者的位置与朝向&lt;br/&gt;(整个场景共享一个)&quot;]\">flowchart TD\n  L1[\"StereoPannerNode&lt;br/&gt;一维: 左 ↔ 右&lt;br/&gt;只改左右声道响度\"] --&gt; L2[\"PannerNode + equalpower&lt;br/&gt;三维位置 + 距离衰减&lt;br/&gt;便宜·近似\"]\n  L2 --&gt; L3[\"PannerNode + HRTF&lt;br/&gt;三维 + 头相关传输函数&lt;br/&gt;耳机上真方位感·昂贵\"]\n  L3 --&gt; LIS[\"AudioListener&lt;br/&gt;听者的位置与朝向&lt;br/&gt;(整个场景共享一个)\"]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>方案</th>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>真实感</th>\n<th>开销</th>\n<th>适用</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>StereoPannerNode</code></td>\n<td>左右一维</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>极低</td>\n<td>UI 声、简单立体声</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>PannerNode</code> + <code>equalpower</code></td>\n<td>3D 位置+距离</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>移动端、大量声源</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>PannerNode</code> + <code>HRTF</code></td>\n<td>3D+耳廓染色</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>耳机沉浸、WebXR</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>关键:空间化总是<strong>一对 source 与 listener</strong>。每个声源有自己的位置,而整个场景共享一个 <code>AudioListener</code>(代表玩家/相机的头),它有位置和朝向。声音怎么呈现,取决于声源相对听者的几何关系。</p>\n<h2 id=\"stereopannernode-最便宜的左右\">StereoPannerNode:最便宜的左右</h2><p>只想把一个声音推到左边或右边,不需要 3D,就用 <code>StereoPannerNode</code>。它一个参数 <code>pan</code>(AudioParam,<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">-1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span> 全左、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span></span></span> 居中、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">+1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">+</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span> 全右),内部按等功率规则分配左右声道响度:</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"js\" data-code=\"const panner = ctx.createStereoPanner();&#10;panner.pan.value = -0.6; // 偏左&#10;source.connect(panner).connect(ctx.destination);&#10;// pan 是 AudioParam, 可自动化做&quot;声音从左飞到右&quot;&#10;panner.pan.setValueAtTime(-1, ctx.currentTime);&#10;panner.pan.linearRampToValueAtTime(1, ctx.currentTime + 2); // 2 秒扫过\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>const panner = ctx.createStereoPanner();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>panner.pan.value = -0.6; // 偏左</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>source.connect(panner).connect(ctx.destination);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// pan 是 AudioParam, 可自动化做\"声音从左飞到右\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>panner.pan.setValueAtTime(-1, ctx.currentTime);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>panner.pan.linearRampToValueAtTime(1, ctx.currentTime + 2); // 2 秒扫过</span></span></code></pre></div><p>等功率(equal-power)意味着声音从一边移到另一边时总响度恒定——简单的线性分配会在中间「凹」下去。它便宜到可以给页面上每个 UI 音效都用,代价是只有左右、没有前后上下、没有距离。</p>\n<h2 id=\"pannernode-完整的-3d-声场\">PannerNode:完整的 3D 声场</h2><p>要真正的三维定位,用 <code>PannerNode</code>。它把声源放在 3D 坐标系的一个点,配合 <code>AudioListener</code> 的位置朝向,自动算出每只耳朵该听到什么。它的能力分三块:</p>\n<p><strong>位置与距离衰减</strong>。声源越远越轻,衰减规律由 <code>distanceModel</code> 决定。常用的 <code>inverse</code>(反比模型)下,增益约为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>g</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msub><mi>d</mi><mrow><mi>r</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>f</mi></mrow></msub><mrow><msub><mi>d</mi><mrow><mi>r</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>f</mi></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><mi>r</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>d</mi><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>d</mi><mrow><mi>r</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>f</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">g = \\frac{d_{ref}}{d_{ref} + r(d - d_{ref})}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.5473em;vertical-align:-0.5481em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9992em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3448em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.3488em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2901em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">+</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mopen mtight\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3448em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.3488em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2901em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose mtight\">)</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.5131em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3448em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.3488em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2901em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.5481em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span>,其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span></span></span></span></span> 是声源到听者距离、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>d</mi><mrow><mi>r</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>f</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d_{ref}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9805em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是参考距离、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>r</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span></span> 是滚降因子 <code>rolloffFactor</code>。直觉:<code>refDistance</code> 内全音量,之外按模型衰减,<code>maxDistance</code> 外不再变化。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"js\" data-code=\"const panner = new PannerNode(ctx, {&#10;  panningModel: &#39;HRTF&#39;, // 或 &#39;equalpower&#39;&#10;  distanceModel: &#39;inverse&#39;,&#10;  refDistance: 1,&#10;  maxDistance: 100,&#10;  rolloffFactor: 1,&#10;  positionX: 5,&#10;  positionY: 0,&#10;  positionZ: -3, // 声源在右前方&#10;});&#10;source.connect(panner).connect(ctx.destination);&#10;&#10;// 设置听者(玩家)的位置与朝向&#10;const lis = ctx.listener;&#10;lis.positionX.value = 0;&#10;lis.positionY.value = 0;&#10;lis.positionZ.value = 0;&#10;lis.forwardX.value = 0;&#10;lis.forwardZ.value = -1; // 面朝 -Z&#10;lis.upX.value = 0;&#10;lis.upY.value = 1;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>const panner = new PannerNode(ctx, {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  panningModel: 'HRTF', // 或 'equalpower'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  distanceModel: 'inverse',</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  refDistance: 1,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  maxDistance: 100,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  rolloffFactor: 1,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  positionX: 5,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  positionY: 0,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  positionZ: -3, // 声源在右前方</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>});</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>source.connect(panner).connect(ctx.destination);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 设置听者(玩家)的位置与朝向</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const lis = ctx.listener;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>lis.positionX.value = 0;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>lis.positionY.value = 0;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>lis.positionZ.value = 0;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>lis.forwardX.value = 0;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>lis.forwardZ.value = -1; // 面朝 -Z</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>lis.upX.value = 0;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>lis.upY.value = 1;</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>朝向锥(directional cone)</strong>。真实声源有指向性(人嘴朝前最响)。<code>coneInnerAngle</code>/<code>coneOuterAngle</code>/<code>coneOuterGain</code> 定义一个锥:听者在内锥全音量、外锥外衰减到 <code>coneOuterGain</code>,模拟「说话人背对你时变闷」。</p>\n<p><strong>位置随时间更新</strong>。<code>positionX/Y/Z</code>、<code>forwardX/Y/Z</code> 都是 AudioParam,游戏每帧用 <code>setValueAtTime</code> 或 <code>linearRampToValueAtTime</code> 更新声源和听者位置,声场就随场景实时变化(见 <a href=\"web-audio-in-games\">游戏与音乐应用</a>)。注意要用 ramp 平滑过渡,直接跳变会爆音。</p>\n<h2 id=\"hrtf-在耳机上重建方位\">HRTF:在耳机上重建方位</h2><p><code>equalpower</code> 模型只能给左右和距离感,前后、上下基本分不清。<strong>HRTF</strong>(头相关传输函数)是质的飞跃:它用人头、耳廓、肩膀对声音的真实滤波数据,模拟声音到达每只耳朵时被身体染色的方式——这正是大脑判断「上方还是下方、前方还是后方」的线索。设 <code>panningModel: &#39;HRTF&#39;</code>,浏览器就为每个方向应用对应的滤波,在普通立体声耳机上重建出惊人的方位感(<a href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/Web_Audio_API/Web_audio_spatialization_basics\">MDN spatialization</a>)。</p>\n<p>代价是它本质上是<strong>卷积</strong>——和 <a href=\"../synthesis/effects-convolution\">效果与卷积混响</a> 同源的运算,对每个声源做一对方向相关的卷积,非常吃 CPU。2026 年的实践共识很明确:HRTF 听感好但很贵,移动端或声源很多时应降级——用一个很短的混响 + equal-power 声像 + 调好的距离函数来近似(<a href=\"https://blog.weskill.org/2026/03/web-audio-api-immersive-soundscapes-for.html\">weskill 2026</a>)。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  Q1{&quot;目标平台?&quot;} --&gt;|桌面+耳机·声源少| HRTF[&quot;PannerNode HRTF&lt;br/&gt;真方位感&quot;]&#10;  Q1 --&gt;|移动端·声源多| EQ[&quot;equalpower + 短混响&lt;br/&gt;近似空间感, 省 CPU&quot;]&#10;  Q1 --&gt;|纯 UI/2D| SP[&quot;StereoPannerNode&lt;br/&gt;左右足矣&quot;]&#10;  HRTF --&gt; BUDGET[&quot;监控 CPU 预算&lt;br/&gt;(见性能篇)&quot;]&#10;  EQ --&gt; BUDGET\">flowchart TD\n  Q1{\"目标平台?\"} --&gt;|桌面+耳机·声源少| HRTF[\"PannerNode HRTF&lt;br/&gt;真方位感\"]\n  Q1 --&gt;|移动端·声源多| EQ[\"equalpower + 短混响&lt;br/&gt;近似空间感, 省 CPU\"]\n  Q1 --&gt;|纯 UI/2D| SP[\"StereoPannerNode&lt;br/&gt;左右足矣\"]\n  HRTF --&gt; BUDGET[\"监控 CPU 预算&lt;br/&gt;(见性能篇)\"]\n  EQ --&gt; BUDGET</pre><p>HRTF 也是为什么空间音频和 <a href=\"audio-performance\">音频性能与延迟</a> 是同一枚硬币的两面:沉浸感的上限往往由 CPU 预算决定,而预算又被卷积类节点(HRTF、混响)吃掉。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>空间化分三层:StereoPanner(左右一维,极便宜)→ PannerNode+equalpower(3D 位置+距离,便宜近似)→ PannerNode+HRTF(加耳廓染色,真方位感,昂贵)。</li>\n<li>空间化是一对「声源位置 + 共享的 AudioListener(听者位置朝向)」的几何关系;位置参数都是 AudioParam,用 ramp 平滑更新防爆音。</li>\n<li>PannerNode 三要素:距离衰减(distanceModel/refDistance/rolloff)、朝向锥(模拟指向性)、可随帧更新的位置。</li>\n<li>HRTF 用头与耳廓的真实滤波数据重建前后上下方位感,本质是方向相关的卷积,极吃 CPU;2026 共识是移动端/多声源降级为 equal-power + 短混响近似。</li>\n<li>空间音频的上限常被 CPU 预算锁定,与性能篇互为表里。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li>HRTF 与混响同源的卷积运算:<a href=\"../synthesis/effects-convolution\">效果与卷积混响</a></li>\n<li>空间化声源从哪来、怎么调度:<a href=\"../nodes/source-nodes\">源节点</a></li>\n<li>HRTF 的 CPU 预算与降级:<a href=\"audio-performance\">音频性能与延迟</a></li>\n<li>多声源位置每帧更新的落地:<a href=\"web-audio-in-games\">游戏与音乐应用</a></li>\n<li>跨库:WebXR/3D 场景里的相机即听者,见 <a href=\"../../webgpu-graphics/practice/performance-optimization\">WebGPU · 性能优化</a></li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"空间音频与声像","id":"空间音频与声像"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"StereoPannerNode:最便宜的左右","id":"stereopannernode-最便宜的左右"},{"level":2,"text":"PannerNode:完整的 3D 声场","id":"pannernode-完整的-3d-声场"},{"level":2,"text":"HRTF:在耳机上重建方位","id":"hrtf-在耳机上重建方位"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":{"title":"Audio Worklet 自定义处理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/web-audio-sound-engineering/synthesis/audio-worklet"},"next":{"title":"音频性能与延迟","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/web-audio-sound-engineering/practice/audio-performance"}}